            "type": "text",
            "x": 34,
            "y": 63,
            "width": 240,
            "height": 295,
            "text": "### Travel guide · Overview (Page)\n\nSeven cities, two weeks A photo journey by train and two flights. Every city has its own page with places, times and tips; the travel diary records how it re…\nAttachments: 1\n\nReference: `glide://list/0a6a1d85cb6c494a8c912e1decbd7d1d`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "page:40aaf8d4124042dfafc37f9abf63633b",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 34,
            "y": 355,
            "width": 240,
            "height": 147,
            "text": "### Evening round · Open questions (Note)\n\nEvening after coming home The journey is over, the selection begins. Out of roughly 230 pictures, 14 should go into the travel book. • Two pictures per city…\n\nLabels: `Photo`\nAttachments: 1\n\nReference: `glide://list/40aaf8d4124042dfafc37f9abf63633b`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "88a48a7eb86d4be9a27a285640a58dff",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 390,
            "y": 64,
            "width": 312,
            "height": 426,
            "text": "### [ ] Choose photos for the travel book\n3 hoch · Planned day: 20.11.2026, 09:00 · Due: 20.11.2026, 11:00 · List: Travel plan\n\nChoose two pictures per city that tell a small story together.\n\n- [x] Raw files backed up\n- [x] First selection marked with stars\n- [ ] Second round: check black and white\n\nLabels: `Photo`, `Approval`\nAttachments: 1\n\nReference: `glide://item/88a48a7eb86d4be9a27a285640a58dff`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "9854cda934f14d2fbf1c70f0790cf9c0",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 735,
            "y": 58,
            "width": 240,
            "height": 337,
            "text": "### [ ] Write the captions\n2 mittel · Planned day: 20.11.2026, 11:00 · Due: 21.11.2026 · List: Travel plan\n\nShort, with place and moment. No camera data in the caption.\n\nLabels: `Photo`\nAttachments: 2\n\nReference: `glide://item/9854cda934f14d2fbf1c70f0790cf9c0`",
            "color": "#217E39"
        },
        {
            "id": "page:cafafefbde0d4e7b91c4ab85b1f25920",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 735,
            "y": 470,
            "width": 187,
            "height": 215,
            "text": "### Travel stamp · Light cycle (Drawing)\n\nA travel stamp with four sky colours from morning to night, a PNG reference and a 16-pixel icon.\nAttachments: 2\n\nReference: `glide://list/cafafefbde0d4e7b91c4ab85b1f25920`",
            "color": "#217E39"
